cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PTPM: Paired Transcriptomic Perturbation Modeling"
abstract: >-
  Protocol for estimating the predictability of a paired transcriptomic
  perturbation phenotype from baseline profiles. It combines patient-grouped
  nested cross-validation, fold-internal feature selection, fold-internal
  adjustment for mathematical coupling between baseline predictors and the
  paired outcome, a 2 x 2 decomposition of the performance gap,
  patient-level bootstrap confidence intervals, and sensitivity analyses on
  pathway scoring (training-reference GSVA, ssGSEA), coupling and pathway
  circularity.
authors:
